WEBVTT

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.560
You get out of here!

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.010
Get out of the city!

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:08.990
Got it?

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.340
A dream?

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.680
<b>Oneiromancy</b>

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.400
Um...

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.320
A dream about dragons means...

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.810
Growth and change.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.180
<b>Dragon</b>

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.180
It implies good luck.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.060
Morning, Soya-kun!

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.350
It's morning, silly! Time to get up and about!

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:49.970
Breakfast is ready!

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.430
Don't just slam open the door, Ginko!

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:56.010
Oh, was I interrupting?

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:56.930
Interrupting what?

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:57.870
No!

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.050
Morning, Sensei.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.820
Okay, let's eat.

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.110
Let's eat.

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.060
Thanks for the meal.

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:20.280
Bye.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.880
Bye!

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:47.210
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:07.040
<b>Episode 1: Light, Seven Flashes</b>

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.040
Meat...

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.300
I want some meat!

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:11.310
Good morning, Kuroi-kun!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.320
Um... Class Rep.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:16.700
Morning.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:22.340
You still haven't learned 
my name yet, have you?

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.430
Well? Are you used to the school yet?

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.900
You've been here for two weeks now.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:32.190
It's okay, I guess.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.030
"Okay," huh?

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.150
There are two major types of winds on Earth,

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.340
prevailing winds and periodic winds.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:43.700
Prevailing winds blow the same direction 
throughout most of the year.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:53.000
Rice, a pickled plum, carrots, 
burdock root, tomatoes!

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.430
Meat! I want some meat!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:58.990
Kuroi-kun, want some of my hamburg steak?

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:00.260
Glasses-sama!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:03.320
Aw, I'm not a goddess...

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.350
Wait, did you say "glasses"?

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.200
Here you go.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.370
Thank you!

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:12.820
How is it?

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.270
G-Great!

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:18.560
<i>But it's made from tofu!</i>

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:19.700
Is that worth crying over?

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.600
Thank you for the meal.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:24.090
Thank you for the meal.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:28.830
Kuroi-kun, did you make any friends?

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.900
No, um...

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.040
I don't know what to talk to people about.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.170
I see.

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:39.800
Class Rep... er, Glasses-sama, 
why are you talking to me?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.250
You just said "glasses," didn't you?

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.630
I actually don't know your name.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.020
Takamagahara.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:48.640
Ta-ka-ma-ga-ha-ra!

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.060
Remember it already.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:54.940
Ta-ka-ma-ga-ha-ra-san,
 why are you talking to me?

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:59.340
Part of it is because I'm the class rep,

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.780
but I transferred when I 
was in elementary school.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.560
And I had trouble making friends back then.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:08.650
I know!

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.900
Why not join a club?

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:14.150
Were you in a club in your 
old school, Kuroi-kun?

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.010
I don't know.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.630
I don't have any memories.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.630
What do you mean,
you don't have any memories?

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.420
I have amnesia.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:27.780
I don't remember a thing from 
before I came to this school.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:35.480
Amnesia?

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.770
Is that true?

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.860
Um... I don't really know.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:44.870
But I guess I was in a big 
traffic accident or something,

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.230
and then went into a coma.

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.000
When I woke up...

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:53.120
Some weirdos had taken me in.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:57.020
What about your old family?

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.460
They died in that accident, I was told.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.420
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.530
It's none of my business.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.550
No, there's no reason to apologize.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.080
It doesn't feel real to me,

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.350
and anyway, not having 
memories doesn't bother me.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.490
Well...

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.690
Not being able to remember is surprisingly...

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.050
Maybe it's better not to remember.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:21.520
But I hope you can remember your family.

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:25.280
It's sad that you can't.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.620
Yeah. Thanks, Tamaragawara-san.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.710
<i>Takamagahara</i>!

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.440
Are you listening, Kuroi-kun?

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:39.880
<i>Math's nice...</i>

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.540
<i>You don't need memories to do it.</i>

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:50.410
Kuroi-kun?

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:55.850
<i>This message is from the Citizens' Safety Center.</i>

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:00.510
<i>An unidentified flying object has 
just appeared over the Pacific Ocean,</i>

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:02.740
<i>and is approaching Soramisaka City.</i>

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:06.510
<i>All citizens are requested to evacuate.</i>

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:07.740
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.910
An unidentified flying object?

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:10.960
What?

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.070
Oh, no...

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.560
Be quiet.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.290
Everyone, leave the room and head to the gym.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.930
What's wrong, Kuroi-kun?

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.450
You need to get out of here!

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:22.640
Kuroi-kun?

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.790
Unknown flying object...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.650
It's a UFO!

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:28.340
I want to see it!

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:30.200
Why are you so excited?

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.760
Come on, we need to evacuate!

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.180
It's a UFO, though! Aliens!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.110
I should be able to see it from here.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:37.660
Kuroi-kun...

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.130
The term "UFO" refers to any 
unidentified flying object,

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.590
and should be considered 
distinct from "alien craft,"

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.670
that is, a vessel used by aliens, Kuroi-kun.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:51.470
In this case, things like missiles and fighter
 jets belonging to unidentified nations,

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:54.430
which have nothing to do with 
aliens but are quite dangerous,

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:56.710
should be considered most likely 
when deciding on a course of action.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.370
So we're getting out of here!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.130
Class Rep, how do you know about that stuff?

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.200
I'm in the occult research club!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.120
Occult?

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.630
You mean like "the occult" kind of occult?

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:33.200
<b>Peas</b>

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.200
Look at that huge object!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:37.410
<b>Peas</b>

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.760
It's slowly approaching us!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.990
Can you believe it?

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.140
We keep getting word that similar objects

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:44.930
have appeared all over the world!

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:46.950
All of them have appeared 
without warning over the ocean

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.340
and are heading toward coastal cities.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:55.010
<i>I repeat, citizens in the 
area are asked to evacuate...</i>

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.160
It's finally here, huh, Sensei?

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.980
We're almost to the target.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.920
What is that thing?

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:01.850
It's huge!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.190
It has to be more than 100 meters tall!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.190
<i>We have permission from the 
Citizens' Safety Center.</i>

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.030
<i>Open fire!</i>

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:07.650
Roger!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:11.200
<b>Peas</b>

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:14.580
<b>Peas</b>

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:22.400
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.920
It hit!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.750
But the missiles' seams burst, 
and the cotton inside came out,

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.790
and then it all fell into the sea!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.720
<i>Seams? Cotton inside?</i>

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:30.760
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:32.580
Hell if I know!

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.050
The light...

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:35.730
Evasive action!

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:36.760
No, I won't make it in time!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:39.980
What's wrong?

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.950
You're spacing out.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:46.180
Oh, um... no.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:49.950
I'm glad we found a good doctor.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:53.460
From now on, the three of 
us will always be together.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.360
Mommy! Daddy!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.870
And there's Taro, too.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.450
The three of us and the dog.

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.220
Together forever...

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:12.630
<i>Come in! What's wrong? Are you alive?</i>

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.970
<i>Is everything okay?</i>

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:15.960
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.690
I think it's time to head home.

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:18.790
<i>You're returning to base?</i>

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.210
<i>Did you take damage, then?</i>

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.710
No, not at all.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:24.380
So I'm going back home.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:25.490
Bye.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:27.080
<i>Hey, where are you going?</i>

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.520
<i>Wait, what happened?</i>

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.100
<i>Hey! Come in!</i>

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.740
<i>What happened?</i>

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:35.950
<b>Peas</b>

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.950
<i>What are these things?</i>

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.440
<i>No military in the world
 can damage them!</i>

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:39.440
Remain calm!

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.040
More locals will be coming here, too!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.500
Wait, is it really an alien?

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.750
<i>It's very dangerous to approach!</i>

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.940
Oh, no! This is crazy!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:49.210
<b>Breaking News: Enormous Flying Object Appears</b>

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.940
<i>Look! That's...</i>

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.210
<i>P-People!</i>

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:52.280
<i>Seven people failed to evacuate! 
They're staring at the sea!</i>

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.220
Let's go!

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:08.230
<i>What just happened?</i>

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.190
<i>The seven of them...</i>

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:16.960
Let's go, everyone!

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:19.210
Psycho Photon Armor!

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.050
<i>What is that?</i>

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.770
<i>What appear to be giants have appeared!</i>

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:38.510
Oh, Soya-kun?

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.010
What is it, Ginko?

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.470
Something really weird is happening!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.470
Can you go outside?

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.390
Somewhere with a lot of space.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.350
The schoolyard, maybe.

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:49.990
Well, find a way out!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.320
Oh, I know. Say you have 
to go to the bathroom.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.110
Or that your stomach hurts.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.500
Sensei and I are on our way,

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:01.400
and I want to meet up somewhere 
with a lot of space.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.990
Not the evacuation facility.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.210
<i>Why do I have to go outside, though?</i>

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.630
"Why?"

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.170
Because it's our time...

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:12.130
No, <i>your</i> time to shine.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.210
What does that mean?

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.800
<i>You're watching the TV broadcasts
and stuff on your phone, right?</i>

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.740
<i>You're going to take that thing out.</i>

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:21.380
What are you talking about?

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.740
Some guys who look like superheroes 
went to do it already.

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:26.520
Isn't it their job to defeat it?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.110
<i>Nope. That's not right.</i>

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:29.770
What's not right?

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:33.190
<i>You have to take out...</i>

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.190
<b>Peas</b>

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.570
...those seven superheroes.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:37.920
Huh?

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:42.700
Can you hear me, everyone?

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:46.700
That is the massive object 
that Nebula brought to Earth.

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:54.460
Your highest priority inside the enemy's 
field is to maintain your armor.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.180
Got it.

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:56.080
Disperse.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.290
Split up and find a way inside!

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.670
Something came out of it!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.940
It destroys whatever it touches!

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:08.650
Be careful!

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.040
Benika, are you okay?

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:10.890
I'm fine.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:13.310
Oh, dear. This seems pretty rough.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:15.400
Where's his weak spot?

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.370
I-I don't see anything that looks 
like a weak spot here, either!

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:20.190
This is Torai.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:22.870
I found what looks like a weak spot in the 
field on the back of the enemy's head.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:23.970
Torai-san,

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:27.830
go inside the enemy from there 
and destroy the enemy's core.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:29.270
Okay, off I go!

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.410
Be careful!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.500
Good luck!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.210
C-Class Rep,

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:38.540
I'm, uh... gonna go to the bathroom!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.420
Kuroi-kun!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.390
Hey, you!

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:43.260
Bathroom!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:44.810
That's the wrong way!

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:45.970
Bathroom!

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:54.270
Why am I taking them out?

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.860
And how—

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.460
Where am I?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:10.890
Mom!

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:11.830
Stop it, it's dangerous!

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:14.960
Mom... Mom's still inside!

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:17.480
Mom! Save my mom!

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:20.220
<i>Oh, when I was in middle school...</i>

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:22.300
<i>When my mom died?</i>

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.160
<i>I was so frustrated that I couldn't 
save her that when I left high school,</i>

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:28.220
<i>I became a firefighter.</i>

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.010
Let go of me!

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:30.020
Mom!

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:31.770
It's okay.

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:34.400
I'll save your mom! Leave it to me!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.490
Mom!

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:44.360
Answer me! It's me! Hideo!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.490
Hideo?

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:50.670
Mom!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:55.670
It's okay now, Mom.

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:59.630
Yeah... you saved me, Hideo.

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:05.340
Mom, I'm getting married soon.

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.720
She's always been there for me, 
ever since I was in high school.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.100
Oh, my.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.750
Congratulations, Hideo.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:14.390
You're all grown up.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.870
Yeah. Thanks.

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.350
I'm glad I got to tell you in person.

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:21.360
And...

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:26.280
And...

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:32.450
I'm really sorry I couldn't
 save you back then.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.780
It's okay.

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:34.860
It's okay.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.820
As long as you're doing well.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:41.630
I see. You became a firefighter.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.020
Wow.

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.400
You worked really hard, huh?

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.270
I did... I really did!

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:57.340
I... wanted to save you that day!

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:01.820
Torai-san.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.160
Can you hear me, Torai-san?

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:07.350
What you're seeing is an illusion.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:10.020
That entire space is the enemy core!

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:11.320
Destroy it.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:12.770
An illusion?

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:14.990
What's wrong, Hideo?

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:17.140
What's wrong, Torai-san?

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:19.540
What are you seeing? Hurry!

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:19.540
Hideo?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.750
I'm sorry, Mom...

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:27.090
I... have to save my friends now.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.640
I quit being a firefighter.

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.920
Now... Now, I'm...

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.260
It's okay, Hideo.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:40.970
Be happy.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:56.870
<b>"I forgive you."</b>

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.370
<b>Peas</b>

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:15.290
Need some help?

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.300
I'm fine.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.340
I can still fly.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.220
Um...

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.090
Good work, Torai-san.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.400
The news choppers are here.

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.740
Then everyone split up

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:28.330
and head back on your own,
so the media doesn't follow us.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.580
Good work, everyone.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:31.340
Roger.

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:32.320
Yeah.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.490
Good work.

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:34.540
Bye-bye!

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.790
The mysterious, massive 
object has disappeared!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.540
Breaking news!

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:42.560
The other massive objects across 
the world exploded almost

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:46.300
at the same time as the one in Japan!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.080
Bye!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.020
See you tomorrow.

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:49.210
So what was that all about?

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:53.210
Kuroi-kun went to the bathroom 
and never came back.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:10.760
<i>Mom, I quit being a 
firefighter and now, I'm...</i>

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:14.590
<i>Now, I'm... protecting the Earth.</i>

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:17.270
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:20.000
<i>Am I going to have to keep doing this?</i>

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:35.380
Um... give me the source of your power.

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.300
Hey, Ginko!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.050
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:42.640
<i>He'll understand.</i>

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:43.820
My power?

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.040
Who are you?

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.730
I can't let you have this!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.130
<i>Looks like it's hanging from his neck.</i>

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.150
There, huh?

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.230
<i>Go, Soya!</i>

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.750
<i>Telekinetic Fusion!</i>

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.750
<i>That's what Sensei says!</i>

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:58.750
What's that?

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:00.450
Sen—

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.760
Wait. What? What is this?

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.180
<i>You're inside Sensei.</i>

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.930
Inside him? Inside him?

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.520
It's kind of warm in here...

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:26.020
It hasn't recovered yet,

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:27.780
but if I just need to transform...

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.740
Psychokinetic Mega-God Photon Armor!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.400
Wha...

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.110
What is that? It's huge!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.530
Hey, he's way bigger than me!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.620
And does this thing even need me?

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.200
Can't Sensei fight on his own?

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:43.280
Focus your mind, and it'll move!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:43.940
Good luck!

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:45.760
That's what Sensei says.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:47.560
<i>"Good luck?"</i>

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.750
Okay...

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.340
If you win, we'll have tonkatsu!

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:51.560
Tonkatsu!

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:52.840
<b>Beef!</b>

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:54.050
Nope.

00:19:59.140 --> 00:19:59.850
What?

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:12.490
<i>Now! Special Technique: Cat Punch!</i>

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:13.940
<i>That's what Sensei says!</i>

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.690
What's a "cat punch"?

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.060
<i>Just focus your mind!</i>

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:17.570
Damn it!

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.690
Go!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.760
Giga Cat...

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:34.690
Hammer!

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:57.150
I-Is that power... Nebula's?

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:58.920
Give it back!

00:20:58.920 --> 00:20:59.630
Pass!

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:09.830
Damn it...

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:15.110
<i>Did they take me in after I lost my memories 
just to make me their soldier?</i>

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.310
<i>I need to get away from them...</i>

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:20.430
<i>Once I eat that tonkatsu!</i>

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:22.140
<i>But where do I go?</i>

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:30.480
Give that back!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:31.550
It's...

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:32.580
Shut up!

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:36.710
This is... This thing...

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.400
You... This thing...!

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:41.560
Damn it!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:43.430
I remember!

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:45.780
Damn it!

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.220
Go back and tell your friends!

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:52.420
I'll beat the crap out of all of you!

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:29.280
Director...

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:30.810
What?

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:33.520
Torai was defeated?

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:39.980
<b><i>To be continued</i></b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:45.100
<b><i>Next Time
Nebula Soldier</i></b>

00:23:42.990 --> 00:23:44.310
"Nebula Soldier."
